 style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9F%8F%E6%9E%97%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%9C\" title=\"柏林以东\"><img alt=\"柏林以东\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9F%8F%E6%9E%97%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%9C\" title=\"柏林以东\">柏林以东</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.2</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>惊魂秀</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：302003</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能一</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能二</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3020/302003/技能一.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3020/302003/技能一 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3020/302003/技能二.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3020/302003/技能二 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3020/302003/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3020/302003/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3020/302003/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3020/302003/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"302003\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302004.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/6f/Belonging-302004.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">调查套装<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Investigation Kit</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />0.12<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>笔记本与手电筒，调查记者的必备之物。纸页中事无巨细地写满了受访者倾听、观察的蛛丝马迹。她从不满足于记录表面。深入黑暗，找寻真相——这是她无法抵挡的诱惑。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302005.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/45/Belonging-302005.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">通勤挎包<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Commuter Satchel</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />35<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>经典款式的通勤包，轻巧耐用，陪伴着受访者奔走于各处现场。年轻的调查记者不知疲倦，她的身影遍及城市的各个角落，而阴影似乎同样如此。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302006.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/4b/Belonging-302006.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">清晰视野<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Clear Vision</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />5.4<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一副简单的平光眼镜。<br />人们似乎总会信任外貌更“资深”的对象，上班第三个月，受访者为自己购置了这副眼镜。她保持镜片通透干净，一尘不染。而无论佩戴与否，调查记者的敏锐与执着永远不会改变。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E7%BA%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%9B%B81.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 铅红的真相1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E7%BA%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%9B%B81.jpg/229px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E7%BA%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%9B%B81.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"229\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E7%BA%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%9B%B81.jpg/344px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E7%BA%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%9B%B81.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E7%BA%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%9B%B81.jpg/459px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E7%BA%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%9B%B81.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1530\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E7%BA%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%9B%B82.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 铅红的真相2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E7%BA%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%9B%B82.jpg/229px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E7%BA%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%9B%B82.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"229\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E7%BA%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%9B%B82.jpg/344px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E7%BA%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%9B%B82.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%85%E7%BA%A2%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%9B%B82.jpg/459px-%E8%A1%A3%E